      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. for the joists, i'm looking at 2x10s spaced at 16 inches on center. if i'm also planning on putting a heavy hot tub in one corner, how does that change the way i calculate those loads? do i need to treat that corner differently than the rest of the deck?",
